# Local Development
# No environment variables required for local development.
# The local server (server.js) uses a local JSON file (data/users.json) for data storage.
#
# Run locally:
#   npm run seed    # Seeds sample data
#   npm run dev     # Starts the local server at http://localhost:3000
#
# Netlify Deployment
# Netlify Blobs works automatically with Netlify Functions.
# No additional configuration needed for deployment.